# The publish script runs from the repo root, so its working files land here.
# tools/lemoine-cut/.gitignore only covers that directory, which left every
# render, download and generated overlay untracked-but-not-ignored at the top
# of the repo. These are all reproducible or already in Drive.
#
# Rooted patterns (leading /) so they apply here only and leave the rules in
# tools/lemoine-cut/ — including the brand-assets/*.mov exception — untouched.

# finished cuts, uploaded to Drive Cut/ by the publish script
/*.mp4

# raw clips pulled down from Drive Inbox, filed back to Drive Source/ by the tidy
/*.MOV
/*.mov

# rebuilt from the brand master on every run
/lemoine-intro-pixel-*
/lemoine-lower3-*
/lemoine-outro-pixel-*

# regenerated and uploaded to Drive by drive_index.py
/INDEX.md
